Package: qld
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Suggests: clang | gcc,
Description: fast, parallel linker compatible with GNU ld, gold, lld and mold
 qld is a linker (link editor) written in Rust. It accepts the GNU ld, gold,
 lld and mold command lines, so compiler drivers and build systems can use
 it with no other changes, and it links in parallel at every stage.
 .
 This package installs /usr/bin/qld with the names compiler drivers look
 for: ld.qld and ld64.qld, found by clang -fuse-ld=qld, and
 /usr/libexec/qld/ld, found by gcc -B/usr/libexec/qld.
